@home.bass commissioned me to make a series of track pictures for their Home Bass FM mixes. This project has been a ton of fun to work on, and I am excited to do more work along these lines in the future. So if you need some track or album art give ya boi a shout.

Check out the mixes at SoundCloud.com/homebassfm for some steller east coast telent.

