Track pic for Lewcid's new EP Ebullition. It's the best kind of wonk bass. Do your self a favor and check it out at SoundCloud.com/lewcidsounds/sets/ebullition-ep

Took inspiration from some mantis heads and the Penrose triangle. This was the alternative cover that we did not end up going with.

