Kollektiv has a special spot in my heart. This weekend we threw Kollektiv 14 and it reminded me why I love this festival and community so much. Every one blew it out of the park. The night had a magical feel that I am sure to be reminiscing about for years to come.

The stage was hands down my favorite to date. I had the opportunity to VJ jam with @waskoav  and @anandfriesen for some seriously scintillating visuals. Stage design by OPD. 
